DELETE /v3/user/tokens/{tokenId}
Invalidate an authentication token, such that it will no longer be valid for future HTTP requests.
Required: tokenId (path) — The identifier of the token to invalidate. The special value "current" may be supplied, which invalidates the token that the HTTP request was authenticated with.

GET /v5/user/tokens/{tokenId}
Retrieve metadata about an authentication token belonging to the currently authenticated User.
Required: tokenId (path) — The identifier of the token to retrieve. The special value "current" may be supplied, which returns the metadata for the token that the current HTTP request is authenticated with.
